# The module a bar plugin imports as `qs.Ui`, which is the import Omarchy's own
# widgets open with. Only BarWidget is here, and deliberately: their Ui module
# has thirty-odd types and reproducing them would be reimplementing somebody
# else's desktop. This is the one that is a CONTRACT rather than a component.
BarWidget 1.0 BarWidget.qml
# The base for an interactive widget — a label you can click. It is the one five
# of Omarchy's eight shipped bar widgets fail on without it.
WidgetButton 1.0 WidgetButton.qml

# ⛔ THE ONE MORE THAN HALF THE COMMUNITY WIDGETS FAIL ON. Probed across 40 of
# the most-installed, 21 name BarIconButton — and a widget that sizes itself
# `implicitWidth: button.implicitWidth` against a type that is not there comes
# out zero-wide: loaded, running, on, and invisible. OpticalGlyph is what it
# draws with.
BarIconButton 1.0 BarIconButton.qml
OpticalGlyph  1.0 OpticalGlyph.qml

# The panel layer. A bar plugin is usually a button in the strip AND a popup
# under it; Panel is the contract for the second half, and the rest is what a
# popup is built out of. BorderSurface/CursorSurface are the shared chrome —
# see CursorSurface for why a row must never colour itself from containsMouse.
Panel              1.0 Panel.qml
PanelController    1.0 PanelController.qml
PanelSeparator     1.0 PanelSeparator.qml
PanelSectionHeader 1.0 PanelSectionHeader.qml
BorderSurface      1.0 BorderSurface.qml
BorderOverlay      1.0 BorderOverlay.qml
CursorSurface      1.0 CursorSurface.qml
PanelKeyCatcher    1.0 PanelKeyCatcher.qml
# ⛔ A LAYER SURFACE, NOT AN xdg-popup, AND THE FOCUS IS PRIMED IN TWO STEPS.
# Both are load-bearing and both are explained in the file.
KeyboardPanel      1.0 KeyboardPanel.qml
PanelHero          1.0 PanelHero.qml
PanelActionButton  1.0 PanelActionButton.qml
PanelToolTip       1.0 PanelToolTip.qml
TextField          1.0 TextField.qml
Button             1.0 Button.qml
Toggle             1.0 Toggle.qml
ToggleSwitch       1.0 ToggleSwitch.qml
PointerMoveGate    1.0 PointerMoveGate.qml
PanelSlider        1.0 PanelSlider.qml
ButtonGroup        1.0 ButtonGroup.qml
ConfirmDialog      1.0 ConfirmDialog.qml
NumberField        1.0 NumberField.qml
Dropdown           1.0 Dropdown.qml
SearchableDropdown 1.0 SearchableDropdown.qml
